{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 13,
  "name": "天火同人",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01814",
              "text": "同人。同人于野，亨。利涉大川，利君子贞。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01814",
                "bodyParagraph": 1750
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01815",
              "text": "象曰：天与火，同人；君子以类族辨物。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01815",
                "bodyParagraph": 1751
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01817",
              "text": "同人卦：聚众于郊外，将行大事，吉利。有利于涉水渡河，有利于君子的卜问。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01817",
                "bodyParagraph": 1753
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01818",
              "text": "《象辞》说：同人之卦，上卦为乾为天为君王，下卦为离为火为臣民，上乾下离象征君王上情下达，臣民下情上达，君臣意志和同，这是同人的卦象。君子观此卦象，取法于火，明烛天地，照亮幽隐，从而去分析物类，辨明情状。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01818",
                "bodyParagraph": 1754
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "《断易天机》解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01820",
              "text": "同人卦乾上离下，为离宫归魂卦。同人卦象征交结情深，两人契义，同心断金。主所求皆得，事事称心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01820",
                "bodyParagraph": 1756
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01822",
              "text": "人类相亲，与人和同；所求皆得，无不称心。 得此卦者，吉祥如意，与人合作共事更佳，上下同心，谋事有成。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01822",
                "bodyParagraph": 1758
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01824",
              "text": "时运：朋友支持，升迁顺利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01824",
                "bodyParagraph": 1760
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01825",
              "text": "财运：合资有利，可以进取。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01825",
                "bodyParagraph": 1761
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01826",
              "text": "家宅：合家欢喜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01826",
                "bodyParagraph": 1762
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01827",
              "text": "身体：燥热之症，另求良医。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01827",
                "bodyParagraph": 1763
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "传统解卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01829",
              "text": "这个卦是异卦（下离上乾）相叠，乾为天，为君；离为火，为臣民百姓，上天下火，火性上升，同于天，上下和同，同舟共济，人际关系和谐，天下大同。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01829",
                "bodyParagraph": 1765
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01830",
              "text": "大象：二人同心，其利断金，君子正心诚意，与人和同之象。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01830",
                "bodyParagraph": 1766
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01831",
              "text": "运势：如意吉祥，与人共事，上下皆和，又得长辈提拔。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01831",
                "bodyParagraph": 1767
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01832",
              "text": "事业：顺利、平安，尤其是在与他人的合作方面会十分成功，宜广泛开展人际活动，建立广泛的联系，克服狭隘的门户之见，照顾各方面的利益，求大同，存小异，坚持正确的原则，必能成就大事业。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01832",
                "bodyParagraph": 1768
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01833",
              "text": "经商：以真诚合作、精诚团结的态度与同行共事，公平竞争，必可获得自己应得的利益。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01833",
                "bodyParagraph": 1769
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01834",
              "text": "求名：自己必须刻苦努力，尤其要取得师长和志同道合的朋友指教、帮助，自己虚心进取，完全能够达到目的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01834",
                "bodyParagraph": 1770
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01835",
              "text": "婚恋：多情、善交际，认识的异性朋友多，故需慎重选择，注意维护双方关系和家庭和睦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01835",
                "bodyParagraph": 1771
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01836",
              "text": "决策：性格开朗、乐观，为人热情，人际关系好，社交能力强，要善于同他人合作，尤其要协调多方面的关系，要有原则性，与不良风气斗争，有魄力，敢作敢为，富有自我奉献精神，并具有统御能力，适于担任一定的负责。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01836",
                "bodyParagraph": 1772
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01838",
              "text": "天火同人卦是异卦相叠而成，下卦为离，上卦为乾。乾为天，为阳，高高在上，把光明洒向人间，给人带来光明，带来温暖。离为火，在下，火光熊熊，也能给人带来光明，带来温暖。由此可见，太阳和火两者的位置虽然不同，但是作用却是一样，可谓是志同道合，由此称为同人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01838",
                "bodyParagraph": 1774
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01839",
              "text": "民间卦象诗曰：天与火，同人；君子以类族辨物。这是告诉人们说，君子要明白物以类聚，人以群分的道理，明辨事物，求同存异，团结众人以治理天下。 同人卦象征上下和同，属于中上卦。民间卦象诗对此卦的描述：心中有事犯猜疑，谋望从前不着实，幸遇明人来指引，诸般忧闷自消之。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01839",
                "bodyParagraph": 1775
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0021",
                "detail-edit-0022"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01842",
              "text": "初九。同人于门，无咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01842",
                "bodyParagraph": 1778
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01843",
              "text": "象曰：出门同人，又谁咎也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01843",
                "bodyParagraph": 1779
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01845",
              "text": "初九：聚集大众于王门，将行大事，没有灾祸。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01845",
                "bodyParagraph": 1781
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01846",
              "text": "《象辞》说：君王走出王门与国人打成一片，谁又会遭受灾祸呢？",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01846",
                "bodyParagraph": 1782
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01848",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，能与人合伙经营获利，或出家远行，或修造门户，或在他处学习。做官的或会受到重用，或有升迁之机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01848",
                "bodyParagraph": 1784
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01850",
              "text": "时运：眼前平顺，外出经营。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01850",
                "bodyParagraph": 1786
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01851",
              "text": "财运：不宜开店，可以行商。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01851",
                "bodyParagraph": 1787
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01852",
              "text": "家宅：家人和睦。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01852",
                "bodyParagraph": 1788
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01853",
              "text": "身体：避地调养，可以无碍。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01853",
                "bodyParagraph": 1789
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01855",
              "text": "初九爻动变得周易第33卦：天山遁。这个卦是异卦（下艮上乾）相叠。乾为天，艮为山。天下有山，山高天退。阴长阳消，小人得势，君子退隐，明哲保身，伺机救天下。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01855",
                "bodyParagraph": 1791
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01857",
              "text": "初九这一爻为同人卦最初始的状态，这一爻属于阳爻居刚位，位正，得势。与“九四”同性相斥，不相应；但也象征他们中间没有私情存在，与人交往的公正与广阔。所以说，是在门外与人交往。虽然没有到达“卦辞”中的“野”那样的大同程度，但已超越在一门之内的狭隘的近亲关系。像这样交往广阔，当然不会有过失。如果你在做事时，出于公心，不偏私，不护短，那么就能得志同道合的人，来一起开创事业。走出家门，去与志同道合的人相聚，怎么会有过失呢？",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01857",
                "bodyParagraph": 1793
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01858",
              "text": "有了问题，到外面求众人的帮助，怎么会有过失呢？走出家门，脱离自己的小圈子，到民众中去，怎么会有过失呢？这就是“同人于门，无咎”。在我国古代，一般有了大事，君王不能解决的大事，便要贴皇榜，请天下有能力之人前来解决。这皇榜一般贴在午门外或城门口，可以使更多的人看到。这就是“同人于门”。所以说，“同人于门”即有求天下贤人辅佐的意思，又有与民众打成一片的意思。能做到这些，肯定不会有过失的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01858",
                "bodyParagraph": 1794
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0023"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01861",
              "text": "六二。同人于宗，吝。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01861",
                "bodyParagraph": 1797
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01862",
              "text": "象曰：同人于宗，吝道也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01862",
                "bodyParagraph": 1798
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01864",
              "text": "六二：聚同族于宗庙，卜祷凶吉，因为面临艰难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01864",
                "bodyParagraph": 1800
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01865",
              "text": "《象辞》说：仅仅聚同族于宗庙，这是狭隘的宗法原则。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01865",
                "bodyParagraph": 1801
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01867",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，事多不定，与宗人朋友多不和，相互多猜忌，面和心不合，容易起是非。做官的没有升迁之机，需耐心等待。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01867",
                "bodyParagraph": 1803
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01869",
              "text": "时运：相忌者多，未能顺遂。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01869",
                "bodyParagraph": 1805
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01870",
              "text": "财运：大宗买卖，留心出纳。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01870",
                "bodyParagraph": 1806
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01871",
              "text": "家宅：长子之力，勤俭起家。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01871",
                "bodyParagraph": 1807
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01872",
              "text": "身体：魂归宗庙，未可多言。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01872",
                "bodyParagraph": 1808
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01874",
              "text": "六二爻动变得周易第1卦：乾为天。这个卦是同卦（下乾上乾）相叠。象征天，喻龙（德才的君子），又象征纯粹的阳和健，表明兴盛强健。乾卦是根据万物变通的道理，以“元、亨、利、贞”为卦辞，表示吉祥如意，教导人遵守天道的德行。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01874",
                "bodyParagraph": 1810
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01876",
              "text": "宗：是宗族。吝：偏狭，鄙吝。从卦象上看，六二属于阴爻居阴位，得位，中正，与“九五”阴阳相应，通常是吉象。但是，在这个同人的卦中，相应代表有私情、私心的存在，这一卦，是在阐扬天下大同的理想世界，需要公正、无私地交往，所以六二与九五相应反而成为不利的关系，因而不相宜。这就像只是在宗族中交往，只是在同姓中交往，有着私心一样。这种宗族和同的态度，虽然不能说错，但也不值得赞扬。这一爻，说明应进一步打破宗族观念，扩大交友的圈子和交往的范围。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01876",
                "bodyParagraph": 1812
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01877",
              "text": "只与同宗人亲附，会有弊病，行事必然艰难。应该把目光放长远一些，多和外界接触。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01877",
                "bodyParagraph": 1813
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01878",
              "text": "《象》曰：“同人于宗”，吝道也。这是告诉人们，不能团结各个阶层的人，是引起麻烦的根源。所以如果你想做事，不要只依赖于同宗族的人。尤其是一些夫妻店、家族企业，处理不好可能会因为利益而互相猜疑，为此伤了亲情。 要打破这个界限，团结上上下下的人，这样对事业会更有利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01878",
                "bodyParagraph": 1814
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "九三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01881",
              "text": "九三。伏戎于莽，升其高陵，三岁不兴。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01881",
                "bodyParagraph": 1817
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01882",
              "text": "象曰：伏戎于莽，敌刚也，三岁不兴，安行也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01882",
                "bodyParagraph": 1818
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01884",
              "text": "九三：将军队隐蔽在深山密林，并且占领了制高点，但长时期不能取胜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01884",
                "bodyParagraph": 1820
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01885",
              "text": "《象辞》说：将军队隐蔽在深山密林，因为敌人太强大。长时期不能取胜，怎能有所作为呢？",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01885",
                "bodyParagraph": 1821
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01887",
              "text": "凶：得此爻者，或有丧亲，或有诉讼打官司之患。做官的须防被免职之忧。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01887",
                "bodyParagraph": 1823
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01889",
              "text": "时运：潜心三年，再谋其事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01889",
                "bodyParagraph": 1825
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01890",
              "text": "财运：可开山林，三年获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01890",
                "bodyParagraph": 1826
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01891",
              "text": "家宅：须防盗贼。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01891",
                "bodyParagraph": 1827
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01892",
              "text": "身体：不良于行。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01892",
                "bodyParagraph": 1828
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01894",
              "text": "九三爻动变得周易第25卦：天雷无妄。这个卦是异卦（下震上乾）相叠。乾为天为刚为健；震为雷为刚为动。动而健，刚阳盛，人心振奋，必有所得，但唯循纯正，不可妄行。无妄必有获，必可致福。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01894",
                "bodyParagraph": 1830
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01896",
              "text": "九三：伏戎于莽，升其高陵，三岁不兴。爻辞释义 伏：指埋伏，潜伏，欲战而不出。戎：指军队，士兵。莽：指荒原草丛，丛林。升：登上。陵：山丘。本句爻辞的意思是：把军队埋伏在密林草莽之中，占据附近的制高点守望着，过了三年，都不敢贸然出兵。九三这一爻，从与其他爻的关系来看，可以这样打个比方：六二是阴爻代表女人，九三是阳爻居阳位，而且处于下卦的最上端，代表男人。而全卦之中，最强势的是九五这位，同样是阳爻居阳位，处于君主之位，是比九三更强一个男人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01896",
                "bodyParagraph": 1832
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01897",
              "text": "九三是一个小国的首领，一个比自己更强大的外帮首领看中了九三境内的一个美女。为了讨好比自己更强大的外帮首领，打算把这位美女派去和亲，可是九三自己看了这位美女，强行把美女留下来与自己成婚。他担心对方的首领一怒之下前来进犯，而自己又不是人家的对手，所以才出现了爻辞中所描绘的那样，带兵埋伏在林莽之中，时刻警惕着，好在盟国没有来犯，没有发生灾难。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01897",
                "bodyParagraph": 1833
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01898",
              "text": "占得此爻者，要注意维持与外界的关系，不要因为一己私利，而将与盟友的关系搞得剑拔弩张，让自己费尽了精力，给自己带来了恐惧与不安。埋伏兵甲于草莽中，三年都不敢与敌人进行正面的交锋，这可真是够谨慎的。可是谨慎总不会犯大错误，虽然伏于草莽中日子清苦，但却可以保存实力。这里讲的可能仍是高宗讨伐鬼方的事情。鬼方是我国古代西北的一个部落。历来我国北部的民族勇猛好战，所以高宗这次征伐最初肯定是出师不利。敌人太强大，怎么办?只能等待时机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01898",
                "bodyParagraph": 1834
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01899",
              "text": "伏兵于草莽中，研究新的作战部署，寻找可以一举歼灭敌人的战机。“三年不兴”，其实也就是说三年后始兴。也就是说三年后打败了敌人。这是面对强敌必须采取的战略战术。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01899",
                "bodyParagraph": 1835
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01902",
              "text": "九四。乘其墉，弗克攻，吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01902",
                "bodyParagraph": 1838
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01903",
              "text": "象曰：乘其墉，义弗克也，其吉，则困而反则也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01903",
                "bodyParagraph": 1839
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01905",
              "text": "九四：爬上了敌人的城墙，城还没有攻下来，继续攻打才能获胜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01905",
                "bodyParagraph": 1841
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01906",
              "text": "《象辞》说：爬上了敌人的城墙，从道义上讲应该停士攻城。之所以继续攻打为吉利，因为困守之敌可能逞其狡诈。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01906",
                "bodyParagraph": 1842
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01908",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，亲友之间会互相猜忌，荣中有辱，结果会好些，凡事须多加提防则可吉祥。做官的若能兢兢业业，则有提拔之机遇，或会受到表彰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01908",
                "bodyParagraph": 1844
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01910",
              "text": "时运：退守不动，反而吉祥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01910",
                "bodyParagraph": 1846
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01911",
              "text": "财运：守货不售，将可获利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01911",
                "bodyParagraph": 1847
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01912",
              "text": "家宅：修缮房屋围墙。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01912",
                "bodyParagraph": 1848
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01913",
              "text": "身体：虽有凶险，终究无害。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01913",
                "bodyParagraph": 1849
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01915",
              "text": "九四爻动变得周易第37卦：风火家人。这个卦是异卦（下离上巽）相叠。离为火；巽为风。火使热气上升，成为风。一切事物皆应以内在为本，然后伸延到外。发生于内，形成于外。喻先治家而后治天下，家道正，天下安乐。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01915",
                "bodyParagraph": 1851
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01917",
              "text": "同人卦第四爻，爻辞：九四：乘其墉，弗克攻，吉。 占得此爻者，要懂得适时放弃。就像登上城墙准备与敌人开战，却放弃了，这样反而能得到吉祥的结果。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01917",
                "bodyParagraph": 1853
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01918",
              "text": "《象》曰：“乘其墉”，义弗克也，其“吉”，则困而反则也。这就是告诉人们说，“准备登城向敌人进攻”，但终于没有进攻，是因为发现这种进攻是不仁义的，这样做能获得吉祥，是因为在困惑时能及时醒悟，反过来能按正确的办法行事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01918",
                "bodyParagraph": 1854
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "九五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01921",
              "text": "九五。同人，先号啕而后笑，大师克相遇。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01921",
                "bodyParagraph": 1857
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01922",
              "text": "象曰：同人之先，以中直也。大师相遇，言相克也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01922",
                "bodyParagraph": 1858
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01924",
              "text": "九五：聚集起来的大众先哭嚎后欢笑，因为大军及时增援，大获胜仗。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01924",
                "bodyParagraph": 1860
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01925",
              "text": "《象辞》说：聚集起来的大众之所以先哭后笑（战斗转败为胜），因为筮遇此爻，九五居上卦之中位，像人得贞正之道，势必化凶为吉。大军会师，是说我军压倒了敌人。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01925",
                "bodyParagraph": 1861
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01927",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，先难后易，是非不一。做官的会先贬后升。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01927",
                "bodyParagraph": 1863
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01929",
              "text": "时运：辛苦有成，得偿心愿。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01929",
                "bodyParagraph": 1865
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01930",
              "text": "财运：小有挫折，终有大利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01930",
                "bodyParagraph": 1866
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01931",
              "text": "家宅：不必惊惶，终于平安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01931",
                "bodyParagraph": 1867
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01932",
              "text": "身体：先危后安。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01932",
                "bodyParagraph": 1868
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01934",
              "text": "九五爻动变得周易第30卦：离为火。这个卦是同卦（下离上离）相叠。离者丽也，附着之意，一阴附丽，上下二阳，该卦象征火，内空外明。离为火、为明，太阳反复升落，运行不息，柔顺为心。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01934",
                "bodyParagraph": 1870
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01936",
              "text": "同人卦第五爻，爻辞：九五：同人，先号咷，而后笑，大师克相遇。《象》中这样解释本爻：同人之先，以中直也；大师相遇，言相克也。这是在说，开始大声痛哭，说明这时内心中正诚信，因不知战事的胜败而焦急痛哭；大军遇到了志同道合者，终于获得了战争的胜利，于是欢笑起来。在寻找志同道合的人时，肯定会有些阻力，不是轻易就能找到的，你可能为此深深痛苦过。但是只要你不放弃，克服这些阻力，终将会达到目的，露出笑颜。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01936",
                "bodyParagraph": 1872
              },
              "patchIds": [
                "detail-edit-0024"
              ],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01937",
              "text": "占得此爻者，当与合作者的谈判正僵持不下时，可能意外地出现一个第三方，使事情向对你有利的方向发展。这个时候，你可以视第三方为“同人”，并想办法扩大自己的战果。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01937",
                "bodyParagraph": 1873
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞与象辞",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01940",
              "text": "上九。同人于郊，无悔。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01940",
                "bodyParagraph": 1876
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01941",
              "text": "象曰：同人于郊，志未得也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01941",
                "bodyParagraph": 1877
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "白话文解释",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01943",
              "text": "上九：聚众于郊外，致祭于神灵祝贺胜利，自然没有悔咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01943",
                "bodyParagraph": 1879
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01944",
              "text": "《象辞》说：聚众于郊外，援助不广，尚不得行其志。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01944",
                "bodyParagraph": 1880
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "北宋易学家邵雍解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01946",
              "text": "平：得此爻者，宜守常，不宜激进。做官的则多有出差的机会。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01946",
                "bodyParagraph": 1882
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "台湾国学大儒傅佩荣解",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01948",
              "text": "时运：闲散之地，诸事无碍。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01948",
                "bodyParagraph": 1884
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01949",
              "text": "财运：郊外立业，暂时无利。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01949",
                "bodyParagraph": 1885
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01950",
              "text": "家宅：平顺无灾。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01950",
                "bodyParagraph": 1886
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01951",
              "text": "身体：恐无生机。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01951",
                "bodyParagraph": 1887
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01953",
              "text": "上九爻动变得周易第49卦：泽火革。这个卦是异卦（下离上兑）相叠。离为火、兑为泽，泽内有水。水在上而下浇，火在下而上升。火旺水干，水大火熄。二者相生亦相克，必然出现变革。变革是宇宙的基本规律。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01953",
                "bodyParagraph": 1889
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-01955",
              "text": "同人卦第六爻，爻辞：上九：同人于郊，无悔。 上九这一爻是同人卦的最后一爻，属于阳爻居柔位，失位，不得势。而且与九三敌应，距离六二又太远，中间有群阳阻隔，如果强行去与六二结交，必然耗费太多的精力，陷入争乱之中。所以不必争取最佳的状态，不如就近结交， 与“郊”之人合同，可以平静无争地生活。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01955",
                "bodyParagraph": 1891
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01956",
              "text": "象曰：“同人于郊”，志未得也。这里指出，“聚合众人于郊外”，显然没有实现自己最初的志向。占得此爻者，你想做某件事，想结交重要的人或志同道合的人，可是想结交他的人太多，发生内争，你也没有机会去结交，那不如去结交较容易亲近的人。上九处于乾卦的最外面，乾为郊野，所以此艾有“同人于郊”艾辞。其实在任何一个社会，都有不得志的人。有能力而不得志，只能隐居于平淡之中，这种人可以称之为隐士。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01956",
                "bodyParagraph": 1892
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-01957",
              "text": "上九就是一位隐士，虽然不得志，但是能够与其他隐士一起安守于偏僻的郊区，因为能够守于平淡之中而无非分之想，所以不会发生悔恨的事情。这就如同诸葛亮在《诫外甥》中所言:“夫志当存高远，慕先贤，决情欲，弃凝滞，使庶几之志，揭然有所存，恻然有所感;忍屈伸，去细碎，广咨问，除闲吝，虽有淹了流，何损于美趣，何患于不济。”在平淡之中能做到这些，则自然会成可进，败可守了。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-01957",
                "bodyParagraph": 1893
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
